      children: "This framework has saved my teams from countless architectural dead-ends. The key insight: start with constraints (regulatory, reliability, budget), not with capabilities. Don't ask \"what could agents do?\"-ask \"what does this system absolutely require?\" Most production systems require predictability over flexibility, making workflows the correct default choice."
