      children: "This checklist has prevented more bad architectural decisions than any other tool I've created. The first question-\"Can you draw a flowchart?\"-alone eliminates most agent overengineering. If you can diagram your solution, you can implement it as a workflow. Everything else is rationalization."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.h2, {
